   "source": [
    "### Theory\n",
    "\n",
    "`Baum Welsh`\n",
    "Learn parameters $\\theta$ (transition, emission, initial probabilities) that make your training sequences likely under the model.\n",
    "\n",
    "Train two separate models for mitochondrial sequences and cytosylic sequences.\n",
    "\n",
    "`Viterbi`\n",
    "For a given sequence, find the single most probable hidden state path under a trained HMM. **Given this model, what is the most plausible way this sequence was generated?**\n",
    "\n",
    "`Cross-validation`"
   ]
  },
